FINALPLAY14 -- the COMPLETE WineD3D-side delta, as one verifiable patch.

WHY THIS EXISTS ALONGSIDE THE NUMBERED PATCHES

The numbered series in this directory is a narrative, not a replayable one. Each
file was generated against whatever the tree looked like at the time, so the set
does not compose: applied in order to a pristine Wine 11.0, 53 of 67 apply and
14 do not -- and the fourteen include 71-dmabuf-presenter, 75-separable-lazy-
stage-selector and 79, which is to say the three that make the shipped renderer.
After the 53 that do apply, 25 files still differ from the production tree,
among them glsl_shader.c, winewayland.drv/opengl.c, swapchain.c, context_gl.c,
cs.c and device.c.

So until this file existed, FINALPLAY14's WineD3D could not be rebuilt from any
recorded source. Keep reading the numbered patches for WHY each change was made;
use this one to reproduce WHAT was built.

BASE

  wine-11.0.tar.xz
  sha256 c07a6857933c1fc60dff5448d79f39c92481c1e9db5aa628db9d0358446e0701

  54 files modified, 1 deleted (dlls/dmsynth/version.rc). The two *.orig files
  in the live tree are patch(1) backups and are deliberately excluded.

REPRODUCE

  tar xf wine-11.0.tar.xz
  cd wine-11.0 && patch -p1 < FINALPLAY14-wine-complete.patch

